<title>USA: COMCAST CORP Q2 SHR LOSS VS PROFIT.</title>
<headline>COMCAST CORP Q2 SHR LOSS VS PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.12   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss		  37,400   profit	16,800</p>
<p> Revs		   1,184,500		  945,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 324,800		  235,800</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.32     loss	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss		 102,100     loss	17,800</p>
<p> Revs		   2,315,300		1,896,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 325,300		  237,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>'97 Q2 shr includes extraordinary loss $0.07/shr from early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>Q2 oper shr loss $0.05 vs profit $0.07.</p>
<p>Q2 cash flow $367.4 million vs $296.1 million.</p>
<p>Net results before preferred divs.</p>
<p>'97 results include operations of Scripps cable properties, acquired in Nov '96, and E! Entertainment cable network, acquired in March '97.</p>
